          "id": 400,
          "title": "Pick an app and workflow",
          "description": "In your form’s Automate tab, add the Make integration, then choose the app and workflow you want to trigger.",
          "rawHtml": "<div class='raw-html-embed'><div style='font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:320px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:10px;color:#697586;padding:0 4px 7px;'><span>Autoresponder</span><span style='color:#6434d0;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #6434d0;padding-bottom:5px;'>Integrations</span><span>Webhooks</span></div><div style='border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(15,14,26,.06);overflow:hidden;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 13px 4px;'><img src='https://formester-strapi.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/thumbnail_make_logo_acdfd09214.png?updatedAt=2026-07-21T19%3A05%3A09.378Z' alt='' style='width:20px;height:20px;object-fit:contain;'/><span style='font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;'>Make</span></div><div style='padding:0 13px 10px;font-size:10.5px;color:#697586;line-height:1.45;'>Build custom automations and integrations with apps.</div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;border-top:1px solid #f2f4f7;padding:9px 13px;font-size:10.5px;'><span style='color:#6434d0;font-weight:700;'>+ Add integration</span></div></div></div></div>",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "id": 401,
          "title": "Build the scenario",
          "description": "Sign in to Make, create a scenario with Formester as the trigger, select your form, then add the destination module and map your fields.",
          "rawHtml": "<div class='raw-html-embed'><div style='font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:320px;'><div style='border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(15,14,26,.06);padding:13px;'><div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#101828;'>scenario editor</div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0;'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#101828;'>Trigger</span><span style='color:#9777e0;'>→</span><span style='color:#475467;'>Formester — New submission</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0;'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#101828;'>Action</span><span style='color:#9777e0;'>→</span><span style='color:#475467;'>Salesforce — Create lead</span></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10.5px;padding:7px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #eaecf0;border-radius:8px;margin:5px 0;'><span style='font-weight:600;color:#101828;'>Full name</span><span style='color:#9777e0;'>→</span><span style='color:#475467;'>Lead name</span></div><div style='margin-top:11px;'><span style='font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#6434d0;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 16px;line-height:1;'>Test scenario</span></div></div></div></div>",
